<title>POLAND: BFK Q3 net rises to 8.2 mln.</title>
<headline>BFK Q3 net rises to 8.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFK SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q3 1996     Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating			     16.60   vs   11.17</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 13.45   vs    6.63</p>
<p>    net					8.22   vs    5.79</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bydgoska Fabryka Kabli SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    100.78   vs   88.08</p>
<p>    costs of sales			52.73   vs   75.26</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs    0.02</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     5.23   vs    0.83</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.15   vs    0.45</p>
<p>    financial costs			4.29   vs    4.98</p>
<p>    investment			     6.71   vs    6.42</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>    operating			     41.01   vs   31.25</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 33.95   vs   16.07</p>
<p>    net				     20.78   vs   11.67</p>
<p>    net sales			    270.37   vs  229.60</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     195.07   vs  197.08</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.06   vs    0.02</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			    13.17   vs    4.40</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   3.02   vs    1.33</p>
<p>    financial costs		     10.03   vs   16.49</p>
<p>    investment			    16.09   vs   22.99</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
